The backend must calculate or validate the adjustment difference and update the stock balance atomically.

Apply the existing authorization system to adjustment operations. If an approval workflow already exists, integrate with it. Do not invent an elaborate approval system if it is outside the existing application's scope.

Never permit an unauthorized user to modify a stock balance directly through an unrestricted API.

